 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 3.128,
   "text": "Grocery stores put the milk as far from the door as possible."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 3.328,
   "end": 4.075,
   "text": "On purpose."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 4.475,
   "end": 6.117,
   "text": "Watch. Max needs one thing. Milk."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 6.317,
   "end": 8.899,
   "text": "He walks in, and bam! Fresh flowers and warm bread."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 9.099,
   "end": 10.571,
   "text": "Smells amazing. Into the cart."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 10.971,
   "end": 13.168,
   "text": "So where's the milk? All the way in the back corner."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 13.368,
   "end": 14.669,
   "text": "So he walks past the chips,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 14.869,
   "end": 16.149,
   "text": "past the free sample lady,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 16.349,
   "end": 19.272,
   "text": "past cereal boxes with cartoon eyes staring right at him,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 19.472,
   "end": 21.84,
   "text": "past a giant tower of soda. Two for five!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 22.04,
   "end": 23.512,
   "text": "Every aisle, the cart gets heavier."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 23.912,
   "end": 25.768,
   "text": "By the time he finally reaches the milk,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 25.968,
   "end": 26.864,
   "text": "his cart is full."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 27.064,
   "end": 29.304,
   "text": "And checkout? Candy and gum, right at eye level."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 29.504,
   "end": 31.659,
   "text": "He came in for a four dollar carton of milk,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 31.859,
   "end": 33.971,
   "text": "and walked out with sixty three dollars of stuff."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 34.371,
   "end": 35.949,
   "text": "That's the trick. The milk is the bait."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 36.149,
   "end": 40.608,
   "text": "Almost everyone needs it, so it goes in the back, and you walk past everything else to get it."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 40.808,
   "end": 44.093,
   "text": "Part of it is practical. The big coolers sit by the loading dock."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 44.293,
   "end": 48.837,
   "text": "And the pricey brands sit right at eye level, while the cheap ones hide down by your feet."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 49.037,
   "end": 52.067,
   "text": "But every extra step is one more chance to grab something."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 52.467,
   "end": 53.981,
   "text": "So next time you just need milk,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 54.181,
   "end": 55.675,
   "text": "walk in. Grab the milk. Get out."
  }
 ]
}